      text: "A settlement agreement is deemed a document in the nature of an acknowledgment of debt by a party. Accordingly, failure to duly perform the obligations undertaken in the document may give rise to consequences that can be relied upon later. Drafting the terms as clearly and practicably as possible reduces the risk of later interpretive disputes.",
